# Capability Statement Color Schemes by Service Lane

**Every capability statement gets a color scheme based on its service lane. This makes them instantly identifiable. No exceptions.**

---

## COLOR ASSIGNMENTS

### Fingerprinting / Background Screening / SWFT / EFT — FOREST GREEN
- **Primary:** `#1a2e1a` (dark green)
- **Secondary:** `#2d5016` (forest green)
- **Accent backgrounds:** `#f0fdf4`, `#dcfce7`
- **Border/tag color:** `#2d5016`
- **Checkmark color:** `#2d5016`
- **Use for:** ATF, DCSA, LARA, DOJ, LiveScan, FD-258, SWFT, EFT, badging, security clearance processing

### NEMT / Medical Transportation — MEDICAL BLUE & RED
- **Primary:** `#1e3a5f` (dark navy blue)
- **Secondary:** `#dc2626` (medical red)
- **Gradient:** `linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a5f 0%, #991b1b 100%)`
- **Accent backgrounds:** `#fef2f2`, `#fee2e2`
- **Border/tag color:** `#dc2626`
- **Checkmark color:** `#dc2626`
- **Section headers:** Use the blue-to-red gradient
- **Use for:** Medicaid NEMT, Uber Health partnerships, medical courier, transportation brokerage, ride coordination

### Drug Testing / Alcohol Testing / TPA — DEEP PURPLE
- **Primary:** `#3b0764` (dark purple)
- **Secondary:** `#7c3aed` (violet)
- **Accent backgrounds:** `#faf5ff`, `#ede9fe`
- **Border/tag color:** `#7c3aed`
- **Checkmark color:** `#7c3aed`
- **Use for:** SAMHSA, DOT, DTMB, workplace drug/alcohol testing, TPA services, MRO coordination

### DNA / Paternity / Genetic Testing — TEAL
- **Primary:** `#134e4a` (dark teal)
- **Secondary:** `#0d9488` (teal)
- **Accent backgrounds:** `#f0fdfa`, `#ccfbf1`
- **Border/tag color:** `#0d9488`
- **Checkmark color:** `#0d9488`
- **Use for:** DCFS, child support enforcement, DDC/Depointe DNA, paternity testing, AABB/CLIA lab services

### Janitorial / Grounds Maintenance / Facilities — EARTH BROWN
- **Primary:** `#451a03` (dark brown)
- **Secondary:** `#b45309` (amber brown)
- **Accent backgrounds:** `#fffbeb`, `#fef3c7`
- **Border/tag color:** `#b45309`
- **Checkmark color:** `#b45309`
- **Use for:** USACE, VA janitorial, grounds maintenance, landscaping, snow removal, facilities management

### Industrial Supplies / Equipment / Parts — STEEL GRAY
- **Primary:** `#1e293b` (dark slate)
- **Secondary:** `#475569` (steel gray)
- **Accent backgrounds:** `#f8fafc`, `#f1f5f9`
- **Border/tag color:** `#475569`
- **Checkmark color:** `#475569`
- **Use for:** DLA, TACOM, truck parts, cable assemblies, safety valves, power cables, industrial equipment

### Courier / Delivery / Logistics — ORANGE
- **Primary:** `#7c2d12` (dark orange)
- **Secondary:** `#ea580c` (bright orange)
- **Accent backgrounds:** `#fff7ed`, `#ffedd5`
- **Border/tag color:** `#ea580c`
- **Checkmark color:** `#ea580c`
- **Use for:** VA courier, NIAID courier, medical specimen delivery, mail/package delivery, logistics

### Notary / Signing Agent / Legal Services — PINK-PURPLE-BLUE GRADIENT
- **Gradient:** `linear-gradient(135deg, #e879a8 0%, #a78bdb 50%, #3b6fd4 100%)`
- **Accent backgrounds:** `#fdf4ff`, `#ede9fe`
- **Border/tag color:** `#a78bdb` (soft purple)
- **Checkmark color:** `#a78bdb`
- **Use for:** HUD, real estate closings, notary services, signing agent, CNTDA, estate planning, legal document services

### Professional Services / Consulting / Staffing — CHARCOAL
- **Primary:** `#171717` (near black)
- **Secondary:** `#404040` (charcoal)
- **Accent backgrounds:** `#fafafa`, `#f5f5f5`
- **Border/tag color:** `#404040`
- **Checkmark color:** `#404040`
- **Use for:** IT staffing, consulting, professional services, administrative support, contract management

